  "description": "A/O Limited Edition Colors featuring a unique 'Water-Transfer' painting technique. Each model water transfer is done by hand and will be unique from one bicycle to the next. There may be small differences and unnoticeable imperfections in the graphics, as it is the nature of these painting techniques.\n\nA perfect bike for beginner to intermediate riders who want to keep it light and fun. The low centered design keeps you in a snug seated position while providing full leg extension to alleviate potential soreness. The handlebars sweep in close to keep your back straight and prevent neck, wrist and elbow pain. The cruiser style seat and thick tires eliminate bumps and vibrations.\n\nRide with confidence and nothing but your surroundings to worry about.",
